# Labs vs factories

cursor-cuda-lab remains a lab. The human types CUDA kernels.
cursor-robotics-lab and cursor-rtos-lab are **learning** repos.
Campaign ROS 2 goes to cursor-ros2-factory (`@init-robot`).
Campaign Zephyr goes to cursor-zephyr-factory (`@init-firmware`).
Do not instruct lab tutors to implement the campaign.
